### Servants of Ratvar - the real clockwork cult (per the ss220.space RU wiki writeup), separate from
### the Cult of Nar'Sie

ratvar-servant-role-name = Servant of Ratvar
ratvar-servant-role-objective = Convert crew at the altar of Ratvar and prepare for his return.

ratvar-servants-title = Servants of Ratvar
ratvar-servants-description = A handful of crew already serve Ratvar, the Clockwork Justiciar, in secret. Convert, build, and prepare for his coming.

ratvar-slab-open-verb = Open ritual wheel

ratvar-servant-altar-no-victim = There's no incapacitated victim on the altar right now.
ratvar-servant-altar-mind-shielded = Their mind is protected by a loyalty implant - the altar can't reach them.
ratvar-servant-convert-success-self = Brass fills your veins - you serve Ratvar now.
ratvar-servant-convert-success-others = { $target } shudders and their hands flash gold for a moment.

ratvar-servant-slab-stun-success = The slab flashes, stunning { $target }.
ratvar-servant-slab-teleport-success = You briefly dissolve into gears and rematerialize.
ratvar-servant-slab-heal-success = { $target }'s wounds knit shut in a wash of brass light.

ratvar-servant-hand-of-midas-success = The stack rings and transmutes into brass!
ratvar-servant-beacon-not-enough-brass = You need { $count } brass sheets in your active hand to place a beacon.
ratvar-servant-beacon-placed = The herald's beacon settles into place with a hum.

ratvar-servant-craft-not-enough-brass = You need { $count } brass sheets in your active hand.
ratvar-servant-craft-not-enough-energy = The cult doesn't have enough energy - { $count } more needed.
ratvar-servant-craft-success = The brass flashes and takes shape!

ratvar-servant-shard-crafted = A strange shard hums out of the workshop, warm to the touch.
ratvar-servant-ritual-started = The summoning rite has begun - hold the altar with at least { $count } cultists until it completes!
ratvar-servant-ritual-interrupted = Not enough of the faithful remain here - the summoning rite falters.

ratvar-servant-construct-limit = The cult already sustains { $count } constructs - none more can be animated until some are destroyed.
ratvar-servant-construct-summoned = Gears grind and lock together into { $name }.

ratvar-servant-deconverted = Holy water washes the brass out of your veins - your bond to Ratvar is severed.

ratvar-servant-conceal-hidden = The gears fold in on themselves and vanish from sight.
ratvar-servant-conceal-revealed = The gears unfold and settle back into view.

admin-verb-text-make-ratvar-servant = Make Ratvar Servant
admin-verb-make-ratvar-servant = Turns the player into a Servant of Ratvar (clockwork cult).
